I see what you mean now timos about how it's bad idea to talk
about pronunciations in terms of english words.  Just because I pronounce
pie and pipe like {pai} and {pyip} does not mean that all americans do the
same.  In fact, according to the abstract in the paper that Oren found, I
may very well be in the minority.

Well, I'm off to learn IPA

